Description: Python terminal client for the BitChat protocol over BLE and LAN
 BitChat is a secure peer-to-peer terminal chat client operating over
 Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) and local area networks (LAN). It features
 decentralized mesh networking, end-to-end encryption with Noise Protocol
 (X25519 / AES-GCM), and an interactive terminal user interface built with Textual.
